  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:390px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-darkblue pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Psychic Vampirism</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/40/Selene_Gallio_%28Marvel_Comics%29_Captain_America_Vol_9_5_Textless.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20190925100909\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Selene Gallio (Marvel Comics) Captain America Vol 9 5 Textless\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/40/Selene_Gallio_%28Marvel_Comics%29_Captain_America_Vol_9_5_Textless.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20190925100909\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/40/Selene_Gallio_%28Marvel_Comics%29_Captain_America_Vol_9_5_Textless.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20190925100909 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/40/Selene_Gallio_%28Marvel_Comics%29_Captain_America_Vol_9_5_Textless.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20190925100909 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Selene Gallio (Marvel Comics) Captain America Vol 9 5 Textless\" width=\"270\" height=\"412\" data-image-key=\"Selene_Gallio_%28Marvel_Comics%29_Captain_America_Vol_9_5_Textless.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Selene Gallio (Marvel Comics) Captain America Vol 9 5 Textless.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Selene Gallio's (Marvel Comics)</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Be a psi vampire.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>feed on the emotions/psionic forces of living beings</b>. Psychic variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Vampiric_Draining\" title=\"Vampiric Draining\">Vampiric Draining</a>. Sub-Power of <a href=\"/wiki/Psionics\" title=\"Psionics\">Psionics</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Psychic_Vampire_Physiology\" title=\"Psychic Vampire Physiology\">Psychic Vampire Physiology</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Variation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Variation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPsychic_Vampirism%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><b>Psi Vampirism</b></li>\n<li>Psivore/Pranic Vampirism</li>\n<li>Psychic Vampire</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPsychic_Vampirism%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user drains the emotional/psionic forces of other beings to sustain themselves &amp;/or increase their existing powers.\n</p><p>User of this power may not be full on Psychic Vampires &amp; thus do not need to do this regularly.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPsychic_Vampirism%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Aura_Absorption\" title=\"Aura Absorption\">Aura Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Augmentation\" title=\"Bio-Augmentation\">Bio-Augmentation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Emotion_Absorption\" title=\"Emotion Absorption\">Emotion Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Life-Force_Absorption\" title=\"Life-Force Absorption\">Life-Force Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Drain\" title=\"Psionic Drain\">Psionic Drain</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Psychic Energy Absorption\">Psychic Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Detection\" title=\"Psionic Detection\">Psionic Detection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Spiritual_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Spiritual Energy Absorption\">Spiritual Energy Absorption</a>; (Varies, some Can Absorb Depending if The Psychic Has Astral Abilities)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Power_Augmentation\" title=\"Self-Power Augmentation\">Self-Power Augmentation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variation\">Variation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPsychic_Vampirism%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Emotional_Vampirism\" title=\"Emotional Vampirism\">Emotional Vampirism</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Memory_Vampirism\" title=\"Memory Vampirism\">Memory Vampirism</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Tantric_Metabolization\" title=\"Tantric Metabolization\">Sex Vampirism</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPsychic_Vampirism%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Vampirism\" title=\"Energy Vampirism\">Energy Vampirism</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Psi-Leech_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Psi-Leech Energy Manipulation\">Psi-Leech Energy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Vampire_Physiology\" title=\"Vampire Physiology\">Vampire Physiology</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPsychic_Vampirism%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Cannot feed on those with a protective charm and amulet.</li>\n<li>Might not be able to feed on those with a <a href=\"/wiki/Psychic_Shield\" title=\"Psychic Shield\">psychic shield</a> around them.</li>\n<li>If they are a full-on psychic vampire, the user needs to feed regularly.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPsychic_Vampirism%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://ben10.fandom.com/wiki/Zombozo_(Classic)\">Zombozo</a> (<i>Ben 10</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://thecasterchronicles.fandom.com/wiki/\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:thecasterchronicles\">Light Incubi</a> (<i>The Caster Chronicles</i>)\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://thecasterchronicles.fandom.com/wiki/\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:thecasterchronicles\">Macon Ravenwood</a>; formerly</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://thecasterchronicles.fandom.com/wiki/\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:thecasterchronicles\">Wesley Lincoln</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Psychic_Vampire\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:whitewolf:Psychic Vampire\">Psychic Vampires</a> (<i>Chronicles of Darkness</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Bloody_Mary\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:Bloody Mary\">Bloody Mary</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>True Knot (<i>Doctor Sleep</i>)\n<ul><li>Rose the Hat</li></ul></li>\n<li>Bo (<i>Lost Girl</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Selene_Gallio_(Earth-616)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:marvel:Selene Gallio (Earth-616)\">Selene Gallio/Black Priestess</a> (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/La_Lunatica_(Earth-928)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:marvel:La Lunatica (Earth-928)\">La Lunatica</a> (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Madelyne_Pryor_(Earth-616)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:marvel:Madelyne Pryor (Earth-616)\">Madelyne Pryor, the Goblin Queen</a> (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Bennet_du_Paris_(Earth-616)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:marvel:Bennet du Paris (Earth-616)\">Bennet du Paris/Exodus</a> (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Wanda Norton/Phyllis Carson (<i>Painkiller Jane</i> 2007 TV series)</li>\n<li>Vetala vampires (<i>Pathfinder</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://starwars.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Vampire\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:starwars:Force Vampire\">Force Vampire</a> (<i>Star Wars Legends</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://coppermind.net/wiki/Returned\">Returned</a> (<i>Warbreaker/Cosmere</i>)</li>\n<li>Colin Robinson (<i>What We Do at Night</i>)</li>\n<li>Vortigaunts (<i>Half-Life</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://dirkgently.fandom.com/wiki/The_Rowdy_3\">The Rowdy 3/Project Incubus</a> (<i>Dirk Gently's Holistic Detective Agency</i> )\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://dirkgently.fandom.com/wiki/Martin\">Martin</a>, Project Incubus #1</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://dirkgently.fandom.com/wiki/Cross\">Cross</a>, Project Incubus #2</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://dirkgently.fandom.com/wiki/Gripps\">Gripps</a>, Project Incubus #3</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://dirkgently.fandom.com/wiki/Vogel\">Vogel</a>, Project Incubus #4</li></ul></li>\n<li>Dandelo (<i>Stephen King's The Dark Tower)</i></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPsychic_Vampirism%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"b1181ab840b9da6d4582f9a1349dfd4c\"